                                  content in different soil chemical fractions and some soil properties. WsEx, water soluble and exchangeable
                                  fraction; Car, bound to carbonates; FeMnOx, bound to iron and manganese oxides; Res, residual fraction; MF,
                                  mobility factor; P, soil phosphorous. **, * and ns indicate significance at the 0.01, 0.05 probability levels and
